+---
+id: ex-finite-q-exact-deformation-on-the-four-torus
+kind: example
+title: "A nonzero Q-exact deformation on the four-torus"
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+domain: mathematics
+library: mathematics
+dependency_level: 2
